/E (The "Automated Waste Manager: Smart Dustbin" project presents an innovative approach to modernizing waste disposal through automation and sensor integration. By employing an ultrasonic sensor interfaced with a microcontroller \(such as NodeMCU\), the system detects the presence of waste or a user's hand, triggering a servo motor to automatically open the dustbin lid. This touchless operation enhances hygiene by minimizing physical contact, thereby reducing the risk of contamination. The smart dustbin is designed to be cost-effective and energy-efficient, making it suitable for deployment in various settings, including homes, offices, hospitals, and public spaces. By streamlining the waste disposal process and promoting sanitary conditions, this project contributes to improved public health and environmental cleanliness.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
