/P 145 0 R
/E (The Autamed Dustbin prototype was successfully developed and tested using the NodeMCU \(ESP8266\), ultrasonic sensors, servo motors, and the Blynk IoT platform. The system was evaluated based on parameters like bin fill-level detection, real-time updates, lid automation, and remote monitoring. The following observations were recorded:)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [4]
>>
