317 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 145 0 R
/E (A second ultrasonic sensor is installed vertically inside the dustbin to monitor the fill level in real-time. The sensor continuously measures the distance from the lid \(sensor location\) to the top of the waste pile. Instead of displaying the fill level in percentage terms \(e.g., 80% full\), the system operates using a threshold-based alert mechanism for simplicity and faster decision-making.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [10]
>>
