/E (The Smart Automatic Dustbin is an innovative solution that enhances hygiene, convenience, and efficiency in waste management. By utilizing sensors and motors, it eliminates the need for manual contact, reducing the risk of contamination and promoting a cleaner environment. The addition of smart features such as waste level detection, IoT connectivity, and odour control further improves its functionality.)
